    "## Sorting\n",
    "- Making the order in the chaos\n",
    "- .sort()\n",
    "- sorted function"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "326e6aa4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
